static GIFT_CARD_AFTER: &[&str] = &["The card is the part people keep: two lines in your own words - one thing they did that you still think about, and a wish - beats anything printed inside it.", "A card is worth the five minutes. One specific line about them, no joke off the shelf, and your name at the bottom, because that is the bit they keep.", "Write the card yourself rather than signing a printed one: name the thing you like about them and what you hope for them, and stop there."];
