    pub(super) const ANY_BREAKFAST: &str = "Porridge with a spoon of peanut butter and a banana, eggs on toast, or yoghurt with fruit and oats: any of the three takes under ten minutes and keeps you going until lunch. If mornings are rushed, boil an egg the night before, refrigerate it, and take a piece of fruit with it.";
