const SCIENCE_STEPS_A_MILE: &str = "About 2,000 steps to a mile, so 10,000 steps is roughly five miles, a 5k is about 6,500 steps and a marathon is around 55,000. Stride length moves that by around a tenth either way - a tall walker covers a mile in fewer - so use it for a pedometer target rather than a measurement.";
