const SCIENCE_BUILDING_STEPS: &[&str] = &["The Leaning Tower of Pisa is 296 steps to the top. The Empire State Building is 1,860 steps to the 102nd-floor observatory. St Paul's dome is 528 steps. A single flight between house floors is 12 to 13 steps, and a whole staircase up to an upstairs flat is usually 14 to 16. A cathedral or a stadium prints its own count at the entrance.", "The Empire State Building is 1,860 steps to the 102nd-floor observatory. The Leaning Tower of Pisa is 296 steps to the top. St Paul's dome is 528 steps. A single flight between house floors is 12 to 13 steps, and a whole staircase up to an upstairs flat is usually 14 to 16. A cathedral or a stadium prints its own count at the entrance.", "St Paul's dome is 528 steps. The Leaning Tower of Pisa is 296 steps to the top. The Empire State Building is 1,860 steps to the 102nd-floor observatory. A single flight between house floors is 12 to 13 steps, and a whole staircase up to an upstairs flat is usually 14 to 16. A cathedral or a stadium prints its own count at the entrance.", "A single flight between house floors is 12 to 13 steps, and a whole staircase up to an upstairs flat is usually 14 to 16. The Leaning Tower of Pisa is 296 steps to the top. The Empire State Building is 1,860 steps to the 102nd-floor observatory. St Paul's dome is 528 steps. A cathedral or a stadium prints its own count at the entrance."];
